# Cloudflare redirect rules — same file format on Workers static assets and on
# Pages. Copied into the build output as-is. Order matters: the first match wins.
# The site moved from a hardware-centric structure to a settings-centric one.
# Both slash forms are listed because the export uses trailing slashes.

/vendors            /manufacturers/        301
/vendors/           /manufacturers/        301
/vendors/*          /manufacturers/:splat  301
/tools/glossary     /glossary/             301
/tools/glossary/    /glossary/             301
/tools/glossary/*   /glossary/             301
/tools              /glossary/             301
/tools/             /glossary/             301
